# Product Vision — Office Hours Queue

The Office Hours Queue application aims to streamline the management of university office-hours sessions by providing a centralised digital queue system for students and instructors. Students will be able to view available office-hours sessions, join queues with descriptions of their questions, and monitor their positions and estimated waiting times. Instructors and teaching assistants will be able to manage office-hours sessions, view waiting students, call the next student, and record completed interactions. The system aims to reduce physical queues, improve the organisation of office hours, and provide students with greater visibility over their waiting times.
